<title>USA: Gadzooks Q4 same-store sales up 3.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Gadzooks Q4 same-store sales up 3.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gadzooks Inc said same-store sales for the fourth quarter rose 3.9 percent and total sales jumped 51.5 percent to $45,228,000 from $29,849,000 last year.</p>
<p>Full-year sales rose 51.8 percent to $128,388,000 for the 53 weeks of fiscal 1996 compared to $84,602,000 last year, with same-store sales up 6.1 percent for the period.</p>
</text>
